    {
      "id": "u_ea95d6c535381c3734c1beb0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium is an offline-first note-taking application that stores all data locally on the desktop client. However, it also offers the option to set up synchronization with a server instance, allowing multiple desktop clients to sync with a central server. This creates a star-shaped topology:",
      "sourceHash": "ea95d6c535381c3734c1beb0dd7d4409c1c998e14321cda175e9395ef37361c5",
      "context": "Synchronization",
      "contextHash": "733736e784bf6c3b073020aa6ba0aaf24c60b8daf16b42b7e85673593ba9c172",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Trilium はオフラインファーストのメモアプリであり、すべてのデータをデスクトップクライアント上のローカルに保存します。ただし、サーバーインスタンスとの同期を設定するオプションも提供されており、複数のデスクトップクライアントを中央サーバーと同期させることができます。これにより、スター型のトポロジが形成されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a4edecd0feffaf771c785e7d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In this setup, a central server (referred to as the __TRILIUM_PH_0__sync server__TRILIUM_PH_1__) and multiple __TRILIUM_PH_2__client__TRILIUM_PH_3__ (or __TRILIUM_PH_4__desktop__TRILIUM_PH_5__) instances synchronize with the sync server. Once configured, synchronization is automatic and ongoing, requiring no manual intervention.",
      "sourceHash": "a4edecd0feffaf771c785e7d1b48378b5be6169701bdf8979cd9b51dd0678728",
      "context": "Synchronization",
      "contextHash": "733736e784bf6c3b073020aa6ba0aaf24c60b8daf16b42b7e85673593ba9c172",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "この構成では、中央サーバー（__TRILIUM_PH_0__同期サーバー__TRILIUM_PH_1__と呼びます）と複数の__TRILIUM_PH_2__クライアント__TRILIUM_PH_3__（または__TRILIUM_PH_4__デスクトップ__TRILIUM_PH_5__）インスタンスが同期サーバーと同期します。一度設定すると、同期は自動的かつ継続的に行われ、手動での操作は必要ありません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
