    {
      "id": "u_88e87b06f4d80fd014a02b4c_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Security Considerations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "88e87b06f4d80fd014a02b4c7d04e510cc42afdd8144df88cedf26f88cabbb26",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Security Considerations",
      "contextHash": "47bae706b3393b51f3d841a2829b70c617c4426234f30173f6aa4235e776c99e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "セキュリティに関する考慮事項__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_32d3f262ae58c943fe9c3aba_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Setting up the server securely is critical and can be complex. It is crucial to use a valid __TRILIUM_PH_0__TLS certificate__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (HTTPS) rather than an unencrypted HTTP connection to ensure security and avoid potential vulnerabilities.",
      "sourceHash": "32d3f262ae58c943fe9c3aba3c0a57cb097c98d08b4afacab02735cc1ae677c0",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Security Considerations",
      "contextHash": "47bae706b3393b51f3d841a2829b70c617c4426234f30173f6aa4235e776c99e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "サーバーを安全に設定することは非常に重要であり、複雑になる場合があります。セキュリティを確保し潜在的な脆弱性を回避するためには、暗号化されていない HTTP 接続ではなく、有効な__TRILIUM_PH_0__TLS 証明書__TRILIUM_PH_1__（HTTPS）を使用することが極めて重要です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_092a500c0f3363c4e7d62120_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "092a500c0f3363c4e7d62120f5261061ce2597a27deacb8f1392987c3da7e9c4",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "デスクトップインスタンスと同期サーバーの同期__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3682be872c379242421f533f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This method is used when you already have a desktop instance of Trilium and want to set up a sync server on your web host.",
      "sourceHash": "3682be872c379242421f533f9ac8922847b8af0caa609a8648ca0ca84abad76d",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "この方法は、すでに Trilium のデスクトップインスタンスがあり、Web ホスト上に同期サーバーを設定したい場合に使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fdf079180d7aed7c50eb6c20_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Server Deployment__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Ensure your server instance is deployed but uninitialized.",
      "sourceHash": "fdf079180d7aed7c50eb6c20fd058ec725314f34cbcd92400c9f94c82b827b8d",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__サーバーのデプロイ__TRILIUM_PH_1__：サーバーインスタンスがデプロイされているが、初期化されていないことを確認します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f09fab6ab88781a0c119551_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Desktop Configuration__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Open your desktop instance, navigate to __TRILIUM_PH_2__Options__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Sync__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__Sync server__TRILIUM_PH_7__, and set the __TRILIUM_PH_8__Server address__TRILIUM_PH_9__ to your sync server's address.",
      "sourceHash": "5f09fab6ab88781a0c11955169650abc6e1faab2284ec9f05292630151ae72db",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__デスクトップの設定__TRILIUM_PH_1__：デスクトップインスタンスを開き、__TRILIUM_PH_2__オプション__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__同期__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__同期サーバー__TRILIUM_PH_7__ に移動し、__TRILIUM_PH_8__サーバーアドレス__TRILIUM_PH_9__を同期サーバーのアドレスに設定します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d953cf0c2e1f7f32245f51bf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note that the sync server can also be overridden through __TRILIUM_PH_0__Configuration (config.ini or environment variables)__TRILIUM_PH_1__, case in which that value takes precedence. If that's the case, a field called __TRILIUM_PH_2__Server in use__TRILIUM_PH_3__ indicates it.",
      "sourceHash": "d953cf0c2e1f7f32245f51bf998e8fa984e5e3ac7a7c0ab7f9110a0c20c8300f",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "同期サーバーは__TRILIUM_PH_0__設定（config.ini または環境変数）__TRILIUM_PH_1__によって上書きすることもでき、その場合はその値が優先されます。その場合、__TRILIUM_PH_2__使用中のサーバー__TRILIUM_PH_3__というフィールドにそれが示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_51e33c24c148e6140040a1e2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Testing Sync__TRILIUM_PH_1__: Click the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Test sync__TRILIUM_PH_3__ button to verify the connection to the sync server.",
      "sourceHash": "51e33c24c148e6140040a1e2e79eafafa7bad4af68bb75b7a12c840f977084dc",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__同期のテスト__TRILIUM_PH_1__：__TRILIUM_PH_2__同期のテスト__TRILIUM_PH_3__ボタンをクリックして、同期サーバーへの接続を確認します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_19a6ef296aad977c35905da1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If successful, the client will start pushing all data to the server instance.",
      "sourceHash": "19a6ef296aad977c35905da1075fbd517b19380c85be7a6448ee1c8732bfe815",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "成功すると、クライアントはすべてのデータのサーバーインスタンスへのプッシュを開始します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3670d54fcff85f7fbe830334_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This process may take some time, but you can continue using Trilium. Periodically check the server instance to confirm when the sync is complete. Once finished, you should see the login screen on the server.",
      "sourceHash": "3670d54fcff85f7fbe830334a1a8572845d5835a735099b02d5ab2d86184591e",
      "context": "Synchronization > Setting Up Synchronization > Synchronizing a Desktop Instance with a Sync Server",
      "contextHash": "42af4887b16d2a86bea8a01e34ed784225badb5d161dad304e5ac05ded845571",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "この処理には少し時間がかかる場合がありますが、Trilium の使用を続けることは可能です。サーバーインスタンスを定期的に確認し、同期が完了したタイミングを確認してください。完了すると、サーバーにログイン画面が表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
