      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "同期を成功させるには、クライアントとサーバーの両方の日時が一致している必要があり、許容誤差は最大5分です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_038515c41fe0c740d9dce87d_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Certificate Issues__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "038515c41fe0c740d9dce87d222830b08475cb745829a880b9fe8bae1e2ce156",
      "context": "Synchronization > Troubleshooting > Certificate Issues",
