    },
    {
      "id": "u_301d65f26c0f1a2904a85ea7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When using TLS, Trilium will verify the server certificate. If verification fails (e.g., due to self-signed certificates or certain corporate proxies), you can run the Trilium client with the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ environment variable set to __TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "301d65f26c0f1a2904a85ea701dff4278af4a5a0fe353c23fd35e372251dd1cc",
      "context": "Synchronization > Troubleshooting > Certificate Issues",
      "contextHash": "b5c36b7c368343efba08501d29a58f5e63354810d63e2e94a80560b5eb48289f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "TLSを使用する場合、Triliumはサーバー証明書を検証します。検証に失敗した場合（自己署名証明書や特定の企業プロキシなどが原因で）、__TRILIUM_PH_0__環境変数を__TRILIUM_PH_1__に設定してTriliumクライアントを実行できます：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_11ca0067e6af34e41e2e14df_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This will disable TLS certificate verification, significantly reducing security and exposing the setup to MITM attacks. It is strongly recommended to use a valid signed server certificate. Newer Trilium versions include a script called __TRILIUM_PH_0__ for this purpose.",
      "sourceHash": "11ca0067e6af34e41e2e14df8acc50579a5bb9188b279156867e97b6fcf4c941",
      "context": "Synchronization > Troubleshooting > Certificate Issues",
      "contextHash": "b5c36b7c368343efba08501d29a58f5e63354810d63e2e94a80560b5eb48289f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これによりTLS証明書の検証が無効化され、セキュリティが大幅に低下し、中間者攻撃（MITM）に対して環境が脆弱になります。有効な署名済みサーバー証明書を使用することを強く推奨します。新しいバージョンのTriliumには、この目的のために__TRILIUM_PH_0__というスクリプトが含まれています。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_12324869256c95f21cf09a2a_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Conflict Resolution__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "12324869256c95f21cf09a2af792dd211ab51351702dd738b2ac69f2205d836b",
      "context": "Synchronization > Troubleshooting > Conflict Resolution",
