    {
      "id": "u_2cfc3e5c163fcf722d4ab974_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you edit the same note on multiple instances before synchronization, Trilium resolves conflicts by retaining the newer change and discarding the older one. The older version remains accessible in __TRILIUM_PH_0__note revisions__TRILIUM_PH_1__, allowing data recovery if needed.",
      "sourceHash": "2cfc3e5c163fcf722d4ab974202fff6fca55c01954f5795e38296832f1ba784f",
      "context": "Synchronization > Troubleshooting > Conflict Resolution",
      "contextHash": "7a2b9f212f51fcad79dd6d7648b48a3ab9c97b66265fb1e597ddb96f222dcfdb",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "同期の前に複数のインスタンスで同じノートを編集した場合、Triliumは新しい方の変更を保持し、古い方を破棄することで競合を解決します。古いバージョンは__TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートの履歴__TRILIUM_PH_1__でアクセス可能なままであるため、必要に応じてデータを復元できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
